262-3. For any particular random environment, characterize its attainable response cone \(\{\mathbb E[f f^\dagger]\}\), rather than replacing it by all positive matrices without proof.
263:4. Establish whether the all-rank constant-output-Bloch-length classification in C2 is already explicit in quantum-channel or statistical-optics literature. Correctness is not novelty.
